---
// A REAL 404 [D:site-deploy]: without dist/404.html, Cloudflare Pages
// falls back to index.html WITH STATUS 200 for every missing path — so
// pre-first-release, `curl -fsSL weir.sh/install.sh | sh` piped the
// HOMEPAGE into sh instead of failing. A missing path must fail like
// one, most of all at the install line.
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Not found">
  <h1>404 — no such page</h1>
  <p>
    Nothing lives at this path. The <a href="/docs/guide/">guide</a>,
    <a href="/docs/install/">install</a>, and the
    <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a> are good places to restart from.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you expected the installer here: it exists once a release is
    published — see <a href="/docs/install/">install</a> for the manual
    routes meanwhile.
  </p>
</Base>
